    "created_at": "2025-02-28T14:44:20Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-02-28T14:44:20Z",
    "body": "I'm not really sure how to reconcile that statement with the idea that the specification can just define it as a constant. If it's always going to return 2, people will know they can have two actions (and maybe more). They don't need that attribute for that.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
