    "updated_at": "2025-02-28T15:52:28Z",
    "body": "Ah okay, if we go that route, I'd also vote to throw for extra actions rather than simply ignore as the current spec says:\n\n> For each entry in options[\"[actions](https://notifications.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-notificationoptions-actions)\"], up to the [maximum number of actions](https://notifications.spec.whatwg.org/#maximum-number-of-actions) supported (skip any excess entries):\n\nIf it'll be 2 everywhere then we don't really get anything by silently ignoring, it only becomes a footgun.\n\nEdit: But the current validation steps for other fields also just ignore invalid values...",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
